{"id": 996273, "slug": "kong-long-dao-ju-shou-dao", "name": "恐龙岛(巨兽岛)", "name_original": "恐龙岛(巨兽岛)", "description": "<p>本游戏的核心玩法是击杀恐龙获得积分，积分越高，可以获得越高的排名。 </p><p>玩家扮演恐龙在一座岛屿上与其他恐龙战斗，击杀恐龙可以获得积分，并且获得经验成长，在恐龙成长过程中可能会升级恐龙或者获得超级进化，提升自身的战斗力。 </p><p>在游戏中击杀恐龙有概率获得龙币、龙晶，使用龙币、龙晶可购买不同的恐龙皮肤。 </p><p><strong>移动：</strong> </p><p>游戏中可以按WASD进行移动，同时可以按住SHIFT+WASD进行奔跑。 </p><p><strong>攻击：</strong> </p><p>游戏中可以使用鼠标进行攻击，一般使用鼠标左键攻击，某些恐龙有两种攻击方式，第二种攻击方式是右键攻击。在与其他恐龙战斗时，中可以根据不同的恐龙采用不同的战术，可以选择不同的攻击方式、走位方式、地形等。 </p><p><strong>体力：</strong> </p><p>奔跑、跳跃、以及某些特殊攻击会消耗体力，当体力不足时，则不能进行以上操作。 </p><p><strong>进化：</strong> </p><p>击杀恐龙、吃肉、喝水能获得经验，经验满之后可以进化成更高一级的恐龙或者超级进化成其他恐龙，无论何种进化，都能使恐龙的属性得到加强。 </p><p> </p><p><strong>多样的恐龙：</strong> </p><p>在游戏中总共有8种恐龙，进化过程中的恐龙是随机的，不同种类的恐龙需要设计不同的战术。</p><p><strong>其他：</strong></p><p>按H可以切换休息和非休息状态，休息状态下可以加快体力恢复。</p><p>在吃肉或者其他操作时，需要时刻观察周围环境，四周的恐龙可能会随时袭击你。</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-16", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-01-20T07:27:26", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/1f8/1f8844b07dbb77817c48ed7c4265c10d.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/460/460875de36f4639b2b54a8f88d792bf9.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 8, "added_by_status": {"owned": 4, "toplay": 2, "dropped": 1, "playing": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 27, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 419, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "saturated_color": "0f0f0f", "dominant_color": "0f0f0f", "parent_platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 1, "name": "PC", "slug": "pc"}}], "platforms": [{"platform": {"id": 4, "name": "PC", "slug": "pc", "image": null, "year_end": null, "year_start": null, "games_count": 562874, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/4be/4be6a6ad0364751a96229c56bf69be59.jpg"}, "released_at": "2025-01-16", "requirements": {"minimum": "Minimum:\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\nOS *: Windows 7 64-bit\nProcessor: Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 3.0 GHz\nMemory: 16 GB RAM\nGraphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super\nNetwork: Broadband Internet connection\nStorage: 30 GB available space", "recommended": "Recommended:\nRequires a 64-bit processor and operating system\nOS: Windows 10 64-bit\nProcessor: Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 3.4 GHz\nMemory: 32 GB RAM\nGraphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 3060 Ti\nNetwork: Broadband Internet connection\nStorage: 50 GB available space"}}], "stores": [{"id": 997671, "url": "", "store": {"id": 1, "name": "Steam", "slug": "steam", "domain": "store.steampowered.com", "games_count": 125221, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/d82/d82990b9c67ba0d2d09d4e6fa88885a7.jpg"}}], "developers": [{"id": 460308, "name": "GIANT BEAST STUDIO", "slug": "giant-beast-studio", "games_count": 1, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/1f8/1f8844b07dbb77817c48ed7c4265c10d.jpg"}], "genres": [{"id": 3, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure", "games_count": 152580, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/253/2534a46f3da7fa7c315f1387515ca393.jpg"}, {"id": 5, "name": "RPG", "slug": "role-playing-games-rpg", "games_count": 62291, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/e6d/e6de699bd788497f4b52e2f41f9698f2.jpg"}], "tags": [{"id": 24, "name": "RPG", "slug": "rpg", "language": "eng", "games_count": 26931, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/fc1/fc1307a2774506b5bd65d7e8424664a7.jpg"}, {"id": 36, "name": "Open World", "slug": "open-world", "language": "eng", "games_count": 9355, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/34b/34b1f1850a1c06fd971bc6ab3ac0ce0e.jpg"}, {"id": 149, "name": "Third Person", "slug": "third-person", "language": "eng", "games_count": 14851, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/ee3/ee3e10193aafc3230ba1cae426967d10.jpg"}, {"id": 69, "name": "Action-Adventure", "slug": "action-adventure", "language": "eng", "games_count": 21213, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/275/2759da6fcaa8f81f21800926168c85f6.jpg"}, {"id": 157, "name": "PvP", "slug": "pvp", "language": "eng", "games_count": 12215, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/998/9980c4296f311d8bcc5b451ca51e4fe1.jpg"}, {"id": 571, "name": "3D", "slug": "3d", "language": "eng", "games_count": 94308, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/9d1/9d12fe709e4bc87166b1cdb2101fa91b.jpg"}, {"id": 1656, "name": "mmo", "slug": "mmo", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2304, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/d0f/d0f91fe1d92332147e5db74e207cfc7a.jpg"}, {"id": 180, "name": "Base Building", "slug": "base-building", "language": "eng", "games_count": 3030, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/88c/88c66f471e0b28d3f6711f162ef0848e_IOHyhbU.jpg"}, {"id": 229, "name": "3D Platformer", "slug": "3d-platformer", "language": "eng", "games_count": 12299, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/cfc/cfc91eccc1de338b75a0576310ccbcec.jpg"}, {"id": 91686, "name": "Family Sharing", "slug": "family-sharing", "language": "eng", "games_count": 30523, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/68b/68bcfe02c9b9b7123edab7ecce3f2660.jpg"}, {"id": 126, "name": "Dinosaurs", "slug": "dinosaurs", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1834, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8ae/8ae04040b033c4e16875b34f7d796ac4.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 82726, "name": "GIANT BEAST STUDIO", "slug": "giant-beast-studio", "games_count": 1, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/1f8/1f8844b07dbb77817c48ed7c4265c10d.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "本游戏的核心玩法是击杀恐龙获得积分，积分越高，可以获得越高的排名。 玩家扮演恐龙在一座岛屿上与其他恐龙战斗，击杀恐龙可以获得积分，并且获得经验成长，在恐龙成长过程中可能会升级恐龙或者获得超级进化，提升自身的战斗力。 在游戏中击杀恐龙有概率获得龙币、龙晶，使用龙币、龙晶可购买不同的恐龙皮肤。 移动： 游戏中可以按WASD进行移动，同时可以按住SHIFT+WASD进行奔跑。 攻击： 游戏中可以使用鼠标进行攻击，一般使用鼠标左键攻击，某些恐龙有两种攻击方式，第二种攻击方式是右键攻击。在与其他恐龙战斗时，中可以根据不同的恐龙采用不同的战术，可以选择不同的攻击方式、走位方式、地形等。 体力： 奔跑、跳跃、以及某些特殊攻击会消耗体力，当体力不足时，则不能进行以上操作。 进化： 击杀恐龙、吃肉、喝水能获得经验，经验满之后可以进化成更高一级的恐龙或者超级进化成其他恐龙，无论何种进化，都能使恐龙的属性得到加强。  多样的恐龙： 在游戏中总共有8种恐龙，进化过程中的恐龙是随机的，不同种类的恐龙需要设计不同的战术。其他：按H可以切换休息和非休息状态，休息状态下可以加快体力恢复。在吃肉或者其他操作时，需要时刻观察周围环境，四周的恐龙可能会随时袭击你。"}